      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CAPTAINS KNOCK (5) stretched his winning streak to four when he came from wider to score by 9m here last week. Cruised home by 14m over this longer trip prior, taking his record at the distance to 50 per cent. He has the early speed to take full advantage of a lower draw so is hard to tip against. NYACK (3) makes his first appearance since he placed in all three rounds of the Inter Dominion series in Brisbane in July, finishing third to the elite duo of Captains Mistress and Leap To Fame in the final. Has had eight weeks off since but has trialled in that time and draws well. MAX DELIGHT (7) and JORGE STREET (4) are both musts for exotic players having placed behind CAPTAINS KNOCK last week.",
